Continuation release — FrauBSD / FreeBSD maintenance of Florence after
the SourceForge tree stalled at 0.6.3 (2014).

Changelog:

2026-08-31 Devin Teske <dteske@FreeBSD.org>
	* Version 0.7.2
	* Fix: stock style.rng rejected resize/fn/switch symbol types (XInclude
	  of symbols.xml); cold start FATAL for anyone without a home-theme
	  style.rng override — the failure jrm hit on D58428
	* Fix: fatal-help address is dteske@FreeBSD.org (was f.agrech@gmail.com)
	* Fix: treat compactfn and standardfn as the same Function-keys
	  extension so prefs / GSettings survive layout switches
	* Fix: live-resize baselines view->scalex (not stored SCALEX) so the
	  first drag frame no longer shrinks after RandR / session fit
	* Layout: standardnv adds PrtSc / ScrLk / Pause above Ins/Home/PgUp
	  (arrows stay coplanar with the Ctrl row)
	* Build: regenerate sounds.xml whenever Makefile changes so FreeBSD
	  PREFIX=/usr/local is not stuck with a Linux /usr/share SNDDIR

2026-08-23 Devin Teske <dteske@FreeBSD.org>
	* Version 0.7.1
	* Fn F4/F5/F6 -> XF86AudioRewind / Play / Forward (rewind, play/pause,
	  fast-forward)
	* Fn F10/F11 -> XF86RFKill / Print (airplane mode, screenshot)
	* Fn-layer symbol artwork for those keys
	* About dialog: FrauBSD project home, dual copyright, credits
	* Build: stop vendoring docs/florence.1 and docs/florence_applet.1;
	  configure writes them from docs/*.1.in (with or without --with-docs)
	* Build: distclean leaves vendored payloads in place (sounds.xml,
	  fr/florence.xml, ru/florence.xml); removes autom4te.cache
	* Build: distclean implies clean (top, data/, styles/ Makefiles run
	  clean then local distclean-am; no need for "gmake clean distclean")
	* Build: configure uses unversioned aclocal/automake (no automake-1.14
	  pin) for current FreeBSD autotools
	* Fix: Preferences crashed opening (Relax-NG rejected resize/fn layout
	  actions; sync florence.rng with florence.rnc)
	* Build: PKG_CHECK_MODULES(xrandr); link via XRANDR_LIBS (includes
	  -L… -lXrandr). Ports no longer need LDFLAGS+= -lXrandr
	* Build: shipped configure is 0.7.1 with dteske@FreeBSD.org bugreport
	  (no post-patch reinplace of 0.6.3 / f.agrech@gmail.com)
	* Fix: remove spurious wait() from session-icon draw handler
	  (SourceForge 0.6.3 baggage; implicit declaration was warning-only; no
	  child to reap)
	* Fix: AT-SPI focus callback signature for modern at-spi2 (source
	  builds no longer need -Wno-error=incompatible-function-pointer-types;
	  the FreeBSD port used that flag for 0.7.0)

2026-07-23 Devin Teske <dteske@FreeBSD.org>
	* Version 0.7.0
	* Canonical tree moved to https://github.com/FrauBSD/florence
	* Fix magnifier +/− crash (clamp scale; drop bigger/smaller from
	  default layouts); Resize key with clamped live scale
	* iPad-style sticky modifiers, Caps/Num lock sync, hold-to-repeat
	* Move: WM drag (mouse) vs seat-grab (touch)
	* Session placement above taskbar; RandR portrait fit / landscape
	  restore
	* Framework-style Fn row (2/3-height F-keys, Esc placement, KEY_FN)
	* Unified greeter binary (--greeter / argv0); prefs Close /
	  --export-dynamic and related dialog fixes
	* Fn-layer XF86 media / brightness / display / gear symbols

Bug fix release

Changelog:

2014-11-02 François Agrech <f.agrech@gmail.com>
	* Version 0.6.3
	* Many bug fixes (patches provided by Jeremy Bobbio, Jonathan David
	and Benedikt Spranger)
